One thing that might soften the "death by choking" controversy - at least it
   would have saved several of _my_ characters - would be to have the default
   (i.e. what you get by pressing the space bar) selection for "Stop eating?"
   be "y".  Too often, after a marathon session of NetHack, I'm getting a
   tad bleary, and I hit the space bar in response to pretty much everything.

Or perhaps change the question to "Continue eating?" and have the default stay
   at "n".


